description:
- part single storey part double storey side infill extension up to the boundary with 96 Lauriston Road;
- raise the existing flat roof of the application property by 400mm while maintaining all existing roof pitches, angles and styles;
- increase the height of front dormer sash window by 275mm in response to the raised roof to maintain proportions;
- insert a new dormer sash window at first floor level side extension area;
- insert a new timber sash window to front elevation at ground floor level to maintain the rhythm of openings;
- erect a subservient rear extension at first floor level over part of existing roof terrace clad in timber to reflect it’s lightweight construction and materiality in surrounding gardens;
- alter existing openings between kitchen and garden to created single large opening for ease of access to the garden;
- replace existing pvc front door with a traditional timber door;
- install external condenser unit to the rear of the existing first floor terrace in a timber clad enclosure.
